Aye Chand Moharram Ke Tu Badli Me Chala Ja<br>
Tujhe Dek Ke Marjaye Na Bimar Hai Sugra<br>
<br>
Ghar Zehra Ka Lootne Kiqabar Tum Ne Sunaee<br>
Tujhe Dekh Ke Roti Hai Moharram Me Khudaee<br>
Chouda Sou Baras Bite Hai Sab Karte Hain Shikwa<br>
<br>
Milne ke Liye Bhai Ko Bechain Padi Hai<br>
Kabse Ali Akbar Ki Raahon Me Khadi Hai<br>
Bichdi Hai Ye Muddart Seise Tu Na Nazar Aa<br>
<br>
Veeran Gharoun Me Na Ise Neend Hai Ayi<br>
Akbar Ki Judai Hai Ise Khoob Rulati<br>
Khadmoun Ke Nishan Daanp Ke Baithi Hai Sar-e-rah<br>
<br>
Gin Gin Ke Jo Sugra Ne Ye Din Hai Guzare<br>
Zinda Hai To Akbar Ke Wadoun Ke Sahare<br>
Din Raat Tadapti Hai Ise Aur Na Tadpa<br>
<br>
Behnou Ka Tho Bhai Se Rishta Hi Ajab Hai<br>
Tum Bhool Gaye Mujko Kaisa yeh Ghaazab Hai<br>
Is Aas Pe Zinda Houn Ke Dekhoun Tera Sehra<br>
<br>
Wada Kiya Behna Se Seene Se Laga Ke<br>
Main Shadi Karunga Tho Tere Paas Hi Aakey<br>
Qath Aaya Na Akbar Ka Roti Rahi Sughra<br>
